{"ID":"20240118144951-loq2vnm","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118144951-loq2vnm","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144951-loq2vnm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144951-lcm08zk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122171054-1zka3ym\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:100,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122171054-1zka3ym\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:310,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:350\u0026#125;","title":"382补25白前","type":"doc","updated":"20240204171301"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118144951-lcm08zk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118144951-lcm08zk","updated":"20240122171030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"——长于降气，下痰止嗽，治肺气壅实，胸膈逆满。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171033-gfig0lr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171033-gfig0lr"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】山野多年生草，根死似细辛而大。白色，坚直易折，嘉谟曰，似牛膝短小柔软，能弯者为白微，长坚易折者为白前。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171035-si59vv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171035-si59vv4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】辛苦味甘，性微温，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171038-uxt8tnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171038-uxt8tnt"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】白前为下气降痰要药，主治咳逆上气，肺病痰喘。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171039-iozt8zf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171039-iozt8zf"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】主胸胁逆气，咳嗽上气，呼吸欲绝。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171041-fcsf8gw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171041-fcsf8gw"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】主一切气，肺气烦闷，贲豚肾气。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171042-et9k6wz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171042-et9k6wz"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171043-d53ssff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171043-d53ssff"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】肺虚哽气者忌。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171045-z3u2bhp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171045-z3u2bhp"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【吴克潜】白前能祛痰而利肺气，寇氏称其能保定肺气，治嗽多用。以温药相左尤佳，而时珍谓其性无补益，虽寇氏称其能保肺气，但其功能专于降气，气降故痰亦下，故惟肺气壅实，兼有痰凝塞者，用之无不奏效，若虚者则不宜，之二说者，可并存也，盖惟其泻肺不补，而痰乃能降，气乃能平，惟其祛痰降气，而肺乃得保，气乃得安，正可以互相发明也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122171048-k7nadit","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171048-k7nadit"}},{"ID":"20240122171054-2kiy3vh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171054-2kiy3vh"}},{"ID":"20240122171054-lyrmpni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171054-lyrmpni"}},{"ID":"20240122171054-1zka3ym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171054-1zka3ym","updated":"20240204171301"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"25是白前，这个白前的主要功能是降气，所以，你看，【产地】里说能够弯者是白薇，白薇我们前面介绍过。长的很长、坚、脆，容易折断的就是白前，白前这个药，最重要是，卡痰，肺气下不去。你不要管寒热，病人只要跟你说呼吸不过来，好像很短气，气都下不去的感觉，肺好像变得很小，都可以使用。白前，主治下气降痰的主要药，咳气上逆，肺病喘咳，那里面可能是肺癌，可能是肺气肿我们不管它，如果咳气，那个气由下往上逆，上气，结果咳血，用白前，还有一个是什么？白芨有没有？记不记得我们前面讲过的白芨，本草经这样写“及”，我们现在要加个草字头，白“芨”，吐血，咳血，白芨，还有一个白前在这里哦。所以【别录】"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"说胸胁逆气，咳嗽上气，呼吸欲绝，可能是肺气肿、气喘，肺癌"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，都没有关系。【禁忌】里说，肺虚哽气者忌，你需要用的时候不要去管他的禁忌，一般来说性味，味甘，性微温，这种治病的药，大部分的性都是微温的，白前很好使用哦。"}]}]}